0192: stream the front IMX355 and watch its frame counter (bluecam_stream=1)

With bluecam=2 bluecam_stream=1, after the chip-ID read the front normal
IMX355 (0x10) gets Linux imx355.c's global setting and its 820x616 mode
(19.2 MHz INCK, 4 lanes at 360 MHz), digital gain for all colours, then
stream on for 1 s while the sensor's frame counter (0x0005) is read every
100 ms, then stream off and the usual power-down. No CSI receiver yet:
this only shows that the sensor runs.

